* 
**Higher-Dimensional Data (`.xdim`):** Importing `higher_dimensional_data` provides the transformation matrices required to map spatial coordinates across altered topologies.


* 
**Decision Engine & AI Models:** Engaging `EnergyMatrix` and `call_models(["LMLM"])` allows real-time predictions and interpretation of physical thresholds (such as quantum teleportation feasibility states TP-001 through TP-006).



